---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: SELECT * FROM (SELECT a FROM t UNION ALL SELECT c FROM t) x WHERE a > 1
---
Union
:- Project [CAST(a#0 AS BIGINT) AS a#3]
:  +- Filter (CAST(a#0 AS BIGINT) > 1L)
:     +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0, c#2] (shared #1)
+- Project [c#2]
   +- Filter (c#2 > 1L)
      +- Shared #1, printed above
